# U48 c: import Sub/allflame_exp_030, open the Calcs sub-tab: the stand-in Draw shows
# CompareCalcsHelpers' DrawCalcsTooltip for the CalcSections "Dexterity" cell (breakdown lines of
# both builds; Dex modifiers without modType: FormatCalcModValue, split into common / primary-only
# / compare-only by ModRowKey, sources resolved by ResolveSourceName) and the first "Total Base"
# cell (Life BASE: formatRound values), and DrawSkillBreakdownPanel for both builds' SkillBuffs.
# Three frames: the tooltips are built once (CheckForUpdate) and drawn every frame.
#! u48-expect-text u48 CALCS progress=0
screen 1280 800 dpi 1
fixture userdir=user
frames 2
load-build "Builds/allflame_exp_001.xml"
frames 3
move 116 122
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 718 48
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 640 460
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 640 236
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
press RETURN
frames 3
move 640 236
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 585 625
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 656 138
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
